net "What changed between two dates"
# Two Sentinel-2 images of one place (4 bands, 64×64): band group 1 before,
# band group 2 after. Classes: changed / unchanged.
1 input 1                          # before: (4, 64, 64)
2 conv 32 3x3
3 maxpool 2x2                      # (32, 32, 32)
4 conv 64 3x3
5 maxpool 2x2                      # (64, 16, 16)
6 conv 128 3x3                     # (128, 16, 16)
7 input 2                          # after: the same bands
8 shared 2                         # block 2's convolution with block 2's weights
9 maxpool 2x2
10 shared 4
11 maxpool 2x2
12 shared 6
13 subtract abs <- 6, 12           # |before - after|: large where something changed
14 conv 128 3x3
15 global_pool                     # (128)
16 output                          # changed / unchanged
